      "ogDescription": "El único banknote de polymer emitido en la historia monetaria de Taiwán: 50 Nuevos Dólares, conmemorativo del 50.º…",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/world-polymer/taiwan-50-dollars/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Bank of Taiwan — 50 Dollars (1999)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/world-polymer/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; World polymer banknote catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">World Polymer Banknotes &middot; Taiwan</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Bank of Taiwan</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">50 Dollars &middot; Commemorative Polymer &middot; 50.&deg; Anniversary of the New Taiwan Dollar (1999)</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"taiwan-50-dolares-1999\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/taiwan-bank-of-taiwan-50-dolares-1999-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/taiwan-bank-of-taiwan-50-dolares-1999-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Commemorative polymer 50-dollar banknote of the Bank of Taiwan, obverse above with floating historical Taiwanese notes and Central Bank headquarters, reverse below with the Central Bank of the Republic of China building in Taipei\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"488\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Taiwan (Republic of China)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bank of Taiwan (臺灣銀行), under delegation of the Central Bank of the Republic of China</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Fifty New Taiwan Dollars (伍拾圓 / 50 New Taiwan Dollars)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pure polymer &mdash; substrate Guardian&reg;</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Engraving and Printing Plant (CEPP), Taipei</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1999, Heraldic Year of the Republic 88 (中華民國八十八年)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">160 &times; 70 mm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Numismatic Milestone</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The only all-polymer banknote issued in Taiwan's monetary history</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-1990</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Half a century of New Taiwan Dollar:</strong>This banknote was issued in 1999 to celebrate the 50&deg; anniversary of the introduction of the New Taiwan Dollar, which replaced the old Taiwan Dollar in 1949 at a rate of 40,000 to 1 following a period of post-war hyperinflation.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">An exception in the island's monetary history:</strong>unlike the regular paper series of the New Taiwan Dollar, this commemorative banknote was produced entirely in polymer, becoming the only plastic copy ever issued by Taiwan.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>numismatic composition showing several floating historical Taiwanese banknotes, including specimens with the portrait of Sun Yat-sen; In the background, Taipei's modern infrastructure, including a railway bridge. The header says &ldquo;中華民國&rdquo; (Republic of China).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>facade of the headquarters of the Central Bank of the Republic of China in Taipei; To the right, a modern high-speed train and subtle motifs of the island's historic agricultural industry.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Translucent polymer window:</strong>circular opening at the upper right corner of the obverse with a golden holographic (OVD) patch of traditional motifs and numerical value.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Iridescent Ink Stamp:</strong>reflective geometric rosette in the lower-left corner of the reverse that flashes metallic colors when the note is tilted.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Dual Numbering:</strong>serial number in red ink at the upper right of the obverse, with an invisible-ink control code on the reverse that is readable only under ultraviolet light.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>pink, violet, ocher and multicolored blue undertones.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">Catalog reference Pick-1990, Standard Catalog of World Paper Money; the New Taiwan dollar replaced the old Taiwan dollar in June 1949 at a rate of 40,000 to 1, following postwar hyperinflation on the island.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Close\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/uploads/taiwan-bank-of-taiwan-50-dolares-1999-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img data-zoom-image\n            src=\"/uploads/taiwan-bank-of-taiwan-50-dolares-1999-polimero.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Banknote of 50 Dólares de Taiwán, enlarged view\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Bank of Taiwan",
      "eyebrow": "World Polymer Banknotes · Taiwán"
    }
  }
